236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (SoSA ry participated in Vappurieha, a city-wide event in Lahti celebrating Labor Day \(Vappu\). Since the event targeted families and children, we created an interactive physical photobooth where we took photos for customers and provided them with digital copies via a QR code. I designed the promotional poster, which included instructions, the download link, and various frame options for the customers. To minimize language barriers, I created the poster in both English and Finnish. Since the event celebrates the arrival of spring, I designed the frames using color palettes that evoke family fun and the spring season.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (SoSA ry organized a networking seminar in October 2025 aimed at helping members gain insight into the software industry and the working lifestyle in Finland. I designed the marketing materials on Canva, including critical information such as the event name, promotional tagline, venue, and time. With the event featuring guest speakers from Kempower and Virnex, I included their company logos to communicate to our members that these professional organizations would be present at the seminar.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (To encourage members to join the student community and support the board of directors, I designed the 2026 Officer Application materials on Canva. My goal was to create a sense of belonging and showcase the active student community within SoSA ry. To achieve this, I primarily used group-oriented photos featuring our current association members, highlighting the collaborative spirit of the organization.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
