271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (I collaborated on a comprehensive guide for first-year students to provide them with vital information for their studies. For this project, I provided original photography of locations in Lahti and worked with the SoSA communications personnel to design the booklet on Canva. I wrote the content from my perspective as an international student, focusing on the information I would have wanted to know during my own first year. To ensure the guide remained engaging despite the large amount of information, I used HeyZine to create an interactive digital flipbook and focused heavily on layout design to balance text and photos effectively.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
